  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} div ( {(1)/({75)} + (5)/({12)} of frac{{36}}{{25}}} ) + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} div ( {(1)/({75)} + (5)/({12)} of frac{{36}}{{25}}} ) + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\n⇒ (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} div ( {(1)/({75)} + frac{{3}}{{5}}} ) + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\n⇒ (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} div ( {(1+45)/({75)} } ) + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\n⇒ (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} div {(46)/({75)} } + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\n⇒ (5)/({12)} times (7)/({12)} times {(75)/({46)} } + (4)/(5) times frac{{75}}{{16}}\n\n⇒ (875)/({2208)} + frac{{15}}{{4}} \n\n⇒ (875+8280)/({2208)}\n\n⇒ frac{{9155}}{{2208}}\n\n**∴ The required answer is frac{{9155}}{{2208}}.**",
